{"type":"TEXT","ticket":35996,"id":"26378f06b6024925"}||{"x":150,"y":1048,"value":"RSH1 实际阻值为 20mΩ。\nI = Vshunt / 0.020Ω。\n3A 时：压降 60mV，功耗 0.18W。\n从电池向被测设备供电为正，\n反向充电为负。\nVBUS 测 DUT_PWR_P 端电压，\n不代表外接线缆末端的电压。","fontSize":14,"rotation":0,"color":"#444444","align":"LEFT_TOP","zIndex":3,"yAxisDirection":"up"}|
